  "purpose": "declared bounded traverse for the two questions the recorded data cannot answer. First, the thin cells at the wall: 15:13 has no bounded-tier samples at all and 16:13 has four, so the mask's bounded-tier contribution is measured over the cells that happen to be covered and the cells where the cold-start failure actually stalls are the thinnest. Second, whether a lateral wall slide opens: at 14:12 the mask removes north on a 0.0548 projection while the measured bounded displacement is a 1.73 px slide west, the largest motion in the cell, so a route that must travel along the wall needs the corridor west of it measured before any escape can be built. This contract is v12 with the declared free movement region moved from the southern area to the wall corridor, so the same pulse schedule, the same 400 ms tier and the same gates apply. This version adds the declared stationarity pre-flight: eight frames before the first pulse, and the session is abandoned unless the localised hero stays inside 1.5 px, because the v13 attempt failed with a measured idle drift of 0.4551 px per 100 ms that raised the analyser's idle floor above every bounded press.",
